==Ligurian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lij|/leː/}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|lij|pronoun}}

# [[he]], [[him]]
# [[she]], [[her]] {{q|accusative}}
# [[it]]

====Usage notes====
* Because the pronoun is not gender-specific, it is followed:
** by ''o'' if the gender is masculine
**: {{ux|lij|'''lê''' o l'é bèllo|inline=1|'''he''' is handsome}}
** by ''a'' if the gender is feminine
**: {{ux|lij|'''lê''' a l'é bèlla|inline=1|'''she''' is beautiful}}

